# Text stays LF on every checkout (Git for Windows defaults to CRLF, which breaks the shell scripts in scripts/post-kit)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted (assets/checksums.json pins their bytes; cli.ts doctor checks them)
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
